        </p>\
\
        <p class="mb-4">\
            Its purpose is to ensure that the repository remains understandable,\
            maintainable, and scalable as the platform grows.\
        </p>\
\
        <p class="mb-4">\
            The repository architecture should mirror the product architecture.\
        </p>\
\
        <p>\
            Developers and contributors should be able to understand where new content\
            belongs without relying on tribal knowledge.\
        </p>\
    </section>\
