\
        <p class="mb-4">\
            The repository should evolve with the platform.\
        </p>\
\
        <p class="mb-6">\
            Rather than optimizing for today's implementation, it should support future\
            growth while remaining simple enough for Version 1.\
        </p>\
\
        <p class="font-semibold mb-3">Key principles include:</p>\
\
        <ul class="list-disc ml-8 space-y-2">\
            <li>Organize by purpose rather than by file type.</li>\
            <li>Prefer readability over cleverness.</li>\
            <li>Keep related content together.</li>\
            <li>Avoid unnecessary complexity.</li>\
            <li>Introduce automation only when it simplifies maintenance.</li>\
            <li>Evolve gradually rather than rewriting existing work.</li>\
        </ul>\
    </section>\
\
